Task 1: Build the RBAC Simulator
Understanding RBAC Components
RBAC consists of four main elements:

Users: Individuals who need access to resources
Roles: Job functions (e.g., Admin, Editor, Viewer)
Permissions: Actions that can be performed (e.g., read, write, delete)
Resources: Objects being protected (e.g., files, databases)
