Troubleshooting
Issue: "Permission not found" errors
Solution: Ensure you're creating Permission objects with matching action and resource strings. RBAC is case-sensitive.

Issue: Access always denied
Solution: Check that:

The role has the permission added
The user has the role assigned
The permission action and resource match exactly
Issue: Import errors
Solution: Ensure both files are in the same directory and you're running from that directory.

Issue: Set operations not working
Solution: Verify that __eq__ and __hash__ methods are properly implemented in the Permission class.

